<div class="tk-sol-hero"><div><span class="tk-ip-kicker">SOLUTIONS FOR PERFORMANCE OPERATORS</span><h1>Different teams.<br><em>One connected truth.</em></h1><p>Whether you're acquiring customers, managing advertisers, or reconciling financial outcomes, TraceKit helps connect the evidence behind the numbers—without forcing you to piece together disconnected systems.</p><a class="btn" href="#tk-sol-audiences">Explore Solutions ↓</a></div><div class="tk-sol-hero-visual"><div class="tk-sol-visual-head"><span>TRACEKIT / CONNECTED VIEW</span><strong>CLICK → CUSTOMER → DOLLAR</strong></div><div class="tk-sol-visual-rows"><div><span>Acquisition</span><b>Campaigns · Clicks · Affiliates</b></div><div><span>Commerce</span><b>Orders · Upsells · Rebills</b></div><div><span>Financial</span><b>Refunds · Disputes · Costs</b></div></div><div class="tk-sol-visual-foot">Source relationships preserved. Missing evidence visible.</div></div></div>
<div id="tk-sol-audiences" class="tk-sol-heading"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">BUILT AROUND YOUR BUSINESS</span><h2>Find your use case.</h2><p>TraceKit connects the same underlying evidence in ways that matter to different operators.</p></div><div class="tk-sol-audiences"><article class="tk-sol-audience"><span class="tk-sol-num">01 / WHO IT'S FOR</span><h3>Ecommerce Advertisers</h3><h4>Know what your acquisition really produces.</h4><p>Connect paid traffic and attribution to orders, upsells, refunds, disputes, and financial outcomes. Investigate where revenue and margin change after the first conversion.</p><div class="tk-sol-flow">Attribution → Commerce → Profitability</div></article>
<article class="tk-sol-audience"><span class="tk-sol-num">02 / WHO IT'S FOR</span><h3>Performance Marketing Teams</h3><h4>Move beyond campaign-level reporting.</h4><p>Explore which traffic sources, campaigns, and affiliates are associated with downstream customer activity, while preserving the evidence behind each relationship.</p><div class="tk-sol-flow">Campaigns → Customers → Outcomes</div></article>
<article class="tk-sol-audience"><span class="tk-sol-num">03 / WHO IT'S FOR</span><h3>Agencies</h3><h4>Manage multiple advertisers without mixing their data.</h4><p>Work across independent client contexts with appropriate permissions, client-level visibility, and separate source evidence. Specific agency capabilities depend on account readiness.</p><div class="tk-sol-flow">Client separation → Governed visibility</div></article>
<article class="tk-sol-audience"><span class="tk-sol-num">04 / WHO IT'S FOR</span><h3>Affiliate Networks</h3><h4>Follow attribution beyond the conversion.</h4><p>Preserve provider click and transaction identifiers, reconcile conversion records against commercial outcomes, and make unmatched evidence visible for investigation.</p><div class="tk-sol-flow">Clicks → Conversions → Reconciliation</div></article></div>
<div class="tk-sol-heading"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">PROBLEMS WORTH SOLVING</span><h2>Stop asking which dashboard is right.</h2><p>Start investigating how the underlying records relate.</p></div>
<div class="tk-sol-cases"><div><span>01</span><h3>Which traffic actually led to sales?</h3><p>Relate acquisition identifiers and attributed activity to the commercial records they support, without confusing attribution with causation.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Why don't our numbers match?</h3><p>Investigate differences across provider conversions, orders, payment activity, refunds, and adjustments.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>What happened after checkout?</h3><p>Follow the customer lifecycle through distinct upsells, subscriptions, rebills, disputes, and refunds when source relationships are available.</p></div></div>
<div class="tk-sol-proof"><div><span class="tk-ip-kicker">EVIDENCE, NOT ASSUMPTIONS</span><h2>Every conclusion should have a trail.</h2><p>TraceKit's approach preserves original source identifiers, separates commerce identity from attribution identity, and keeps unresolved records visible. Deterministic relationships take priority over speculative matching.</p><a href="/pages/customer-journeys" class="tk-sol-text-link">Explore Customer Journeys →</a></div><div class="tk-sol-proof-steps"><div><b>01</b><strong>Preserve</strong><span>Original provider records and identifiers</span></div><div><b>02</b><strong>Connect</strong><span>Known transaction and attribution relationships</span></div><div><b>03</b><strong>Investigate</strong><span>Evidence, exceptions, and unresolved gaps</span></div></div></div>
<div class="tk-sol-heading"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">THE TRACEKIT ECOSYSTEM</span><h2>Your systems. One clearer picture.</h2><p>Connect supported acquisition, attribution, commerce, payment, and financial sources. Available integrations and their capabilities vary by provider and account.</p></div><div class="tk-sol-ecosystem"><div>Advertising & Traffic</div><div>Affiliate Attribution</div><div>Commerce & Checkout</div><div>Payments & Disputes</div><div>Financial Outcomes</div></div><a href="/pages/integrations" class="tk-sol-text-link">Explore Integrations →</a>
